  "description": "Baek Do-bin, a trash collector of this post-war era, realized his trash power even today. I even remember drinking alcohol, but when I opened my eyes, what I saw was an unfamiliar hotel ceiling. I was so scared that I put on my clothes and flew them away, but ‘...Why are you out there?!’ The one-night stand appears on TV. Son Jae-hyun, a new male actor from Kookmin University. I promise myself that I will never make this mistake again, but I get entangled with Son Jae-hyun again, and Jae-yeon tells me to take responsibility for what happened that night. “during the day.\n\n[Original Novel](https://ridibooks.com/books/1007090874)\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/garbagecollector)",
